emeraldian (0.6.0-2) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Build exr at opt-level 1, which restores reproducibility on arm64. LLVM
    allocates registers non-deterministically in exr's DWA decoder, reached
    through ratatui-image's image-defaults; zola 0.23.6-4 works around the
    same function. amd64 was unaffected.

